a *passive* medium — it does not orchestrate, schedule, or decide, and it does not itself coordinate; it *enables* coordination by being the shared tuple substrate. (The medium is a logical rendezvous, which may itself be distributed; it provides a shared catalog, not global agreement — consensus, where needed, is layered on top.)\ndocs/design/dao.space.v0.md:68:**interpreted, not a single stored table** — there is no one materialized table,\ndocs/design/dao.space.v0.md:75:quotiented into equivalence classes) it reads against. The tuples are **named,\ndocs/design/dao.space.v0.md:276:and there can be many per stream. Each interpreter materializes the stream into a\ndocs/design/dao.space.v0.md:1092:optional** on top of that floor. Datoms are always self-describing named facts,\ntest/dao/postgraphics/flutter_cljd_test.cljd:89:             (:supported-pipelines policy)))\ntest/dao/postgraphics/flutter_cljd_test.cljd:121:       (filter #(= :text (:pipeline %)))\nsrc/cljc/dao/postgraphics/raster.cljc:345:  \"Rasterize a triangle.  v0-v2 are projected vertices with :x :y :z :inv-w\nsrc/cljc/dao/postgraphics/raster.cljc:503:  \"Rasterize a line segment from v0 to v1 (projected vertices).  DDA with\nsrc/cljc/dao/postgraphics/raster.cljc:588:   Draw keys consumed: :pipeline :op :mvp :model-m :lights :camera-pos\nsrc/cljc/dao/postgraphics/raster.cljc:600:      (let [pipeline (:pipeline draw)\nsrc/cljc/dao/postgraphics/raster.cljc:605:        (case pipeline\ntest/dao/postgraphics/packing_test.cljc:154:           {:passes [{:draws [{:pipeline :camera-reset}\ntest/dao/postgraphics/packing_test.cljc:155:                              {:pipeline :clear, :color [0.1 0.2 0.3 1.0]}\ntest/dao/postgraphics/packing_test.cljc:156:                              {:pipeline :clear, :color [9 9 9 9]}]}]}))))\ntest/dao/postgraphics/packing_test.cljc:161:         (pack/clear-color {:passes [{:draws [{:pipeline :mesh-3d}]}]}))))\nsrc/cljc/dao/postgraphics/lowering.cljc:520:                        